{"id":94,"flavor":[{"games":["Legends: Arceus"],"text":"Possesses potential victims' shadows in an effort to steal away the victims' lives. If your shadow begins to laugh, you must take hold of a protective charm posthaste!"},{"games":["Shield","FireRed"],"text":"It is said to emerge from darkness to steal the lives of those who become lost in mountains."},{"games":["Sword","LeafGreen"],"text":"On the night of a full moon, if shadows move on their own and laugh, it must be Gengar’s doing."},{"games":["Let’s Go, Eevee!","Let’s Go, Pikachu!","Yellow"],"text":"A Gengar is close by if you feel a sudden chill. It may be trying to lay a curse on you."},{"games":["Ultra Moon"],"text":"Even your home isn’t safe. Gengar will lurk in whatever dark corner of a room it can find and wait for its chance to catch its prey."},{"games":["Ultra Sun"],"text":"You can hear tales told all over the world about how Gengar will pay a visit to children who are naughty."},{"games":["Moon"],"text":"It apparently wishes for a traveling companion. Since it was once human itself, it tries to create one by taking the lives of other humans."},{"games":["Sun"],"text":"Should you feel yourself attacked by a sudden chill, it is evidence of an approaching Gengar. There is no escaping it. Give up."},{"games":["Alpha Sapphire","Omega Ruby","Sapphire","Ruby"],"text":"Sometimes, on a dark night, your shadow thrown by a streetlight will suddenly and startlingly overtake you. It is actually a Gengar running past you, pretending to be your shadow."},{"games":["Y","Crystal"],"text":"Hiding in people’s shadows at night, it absorbs their heat. The chill it causes makes the victims shake."},{"games":["X"],"text":"It hides in shadows. It is said that if Gengar is hiding, it cools the area by nearly 10 degrees Fahrenheit."},{"games":["White 2","Black 2","White","Black","Platinum"],"text":"The leer that floats in darkness belongs to a Gengar delighting in casting curses on people."},{"games":["SoulSilver","Silver"],"text":"To steal the life of its target, it slips into the prey’s shadow and silently waits for an opportunity."},{"games":["HeartGold","Gold"],"text":"It steals heat from its surroundings. If you feel a sudden chill, it is certain that a GENGAR appeared."},{"games":["Pearl"],"text":"Lurking in the shadowy corners of rooms, it awaits chances to steal its prey’s life force."},{"games":["Diamond"],"text":"It hides in shadows. It is said that if GENGAR is hiding, it cools the area by nearly 10 degrees F."},{"games":["Emerald"],"text":"Deep in the night, your shadow cast by a streetlight may suddenly overtake you. It is actually a GENGAR running past you, pretending to be your shadow."},{"games":["Blue","Red"],"text":"Under a full moon, this POKéMON likes to mimic the shadows of people and laugh at their fright."}],"abilities":[{"name":"Cursed Body","hidden":false,"description":"May disable a move that has dealt damage to the Pokémon."}],"eggGroups":["Amorphous"],"genderRate":4,"hatchCounter":20,"baseHappiness":70,"growthRate":"medium slow","habitat":"cave","color":"Purple","shape":"Upright","evolution":{"id":92,"name":"Gastly","condition":null,"children":[{"id":93,"name":"Haunter","condition":"Lv. 25","children":[{"id":94,"name":"Gengar","condition":"Trade","children":[]}]}]},"moves":{"game":"Scarlet / Violet","level":[[1,95],[1,109],[1,122],[1,195],[1,212],[1,325],[1,513],[12,371],[16,180],[20,174],[24,506],[30,101],[36,389],[42,399],[48,247],[54,194],[60,138]],"machine":[491,34,280,109,174,399,605,409,227,203,412,263,7,374,411,264,492,202,416,441,114,506,63,8,196,286,282,118,417,101,220,566,398,809,182,244,94,917,240,156,184,247,421,285,806,214,188,482,180,164,241,269,851,168,87,9,86,85,92,390,271,433,474,261],"egg":[],"tutor":[]},"cards":[{"id":"me55-154","name":"Gengar ex","set":"30th Celebration","date":"2026-09-16","rarity":"Special Illustration Rare","number":"154","artist":"CHORISO","small":"https://images.scrydex.com/pokemon/me55-154/small","large":"https://i